Dear MSstats team,

I have a few questions regarding TMT analysis using your package MSstatsTMT.

1. Why normalisation is to be applied after summarisation?
2. What is the difference between summarisation method “msstats” and “ MedianPolish”? In method msstats the summary method is still TMP!
3. The vignette of the package is not explaining the statistical concepts behind TMT analysis. Would you please address me to some resources on this regard?
4. In PDtoMSstatsTMTFormat, the the parameter “summaryforMultipleRows” is set to sum by default. Shouldn’t it be applied after normalisation?
5. Normalization between MS runs will be done by using Norm channels. But don't we also need to normalise between channels after combining the fractions (or before that)?

